<title>PHILIPPINES: MRC Allied says Q1 net rises sharply.</title>
<headline>MRC Allied says Q1 net rises sharply.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industrial estate developer MRC Allied Industries Inc said on Thursday it posted a net profit of 37.4 million pesos in the first quarter of the year compared with 6.8 million pesos in the same period a year earlier.</p>
<p>The first quarter profit came from the sale of residential lots in central Leyte province and a 3.7-hectare land in its Cebu project.</p>
<p>The company said it expected a net income of 197 million pesos this year from 66.4 million pesos last year.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (63 2) 841-8938, fax 817-6267</p>
